# Clamped steel cantilever plate (plane stress): first modes vs. beam theory (f1 = 81.5 Hz for an Euler-Bernoulli beam; the 2-D model is ~0.6% softer from shear).
title Cantilever vibration modes
material E=200e9 nu=0.3 t=0.05 rho=7850
mesh rect w=1 h=0.1 nx=40 ny=4 type=tri6
fix where x==0 dofs=xy
modes n=4
